{"id":"en_bullied-girl","title":"Bullied Girl","titleEn":"Bullied Girl","description":"For sixteen years, Eleanor Vance stood by Leo Carter, shielding him—until he repaid her loyalty by making her the target of schoolwide mockery, all to win Savannah's approval. She leaves for California, and there, at a different school, she finds genuine friendships and a kind-hearted captain who help her grow into a version of herself the old Eleanor could never have imagined. By the time Leo locates her and offers his apology, it no longer matters; she has moved on and built a life that has no place for him. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/bullied-girl/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/bullied-girl/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["New Adult","Strong Heroine","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdosk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_bullied-girl_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdosk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bullied-girl_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdosk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bullied-girl_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdosk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bullied-girl_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdosk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bullied-girl_5","title":"Episode 5"